  "description": "**[Winner of the 4th World Comic Contest]**\n\nHae-joon was having a normal day. He returned home from his part-time job, and there was a man standing in his room where no one should be?! He even passed through a wall and disappeared before my eyes... I thought it was a dream, but what was the identity of Si-yoon, the man I met again the next day?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/49days), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/49days_), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/59737035), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000053159), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8555581)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/49days_), \n[Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/49days)\n\n**Official Translations (Pre-serialisation):**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/4th_world_contest_49days), [Japanese](https://lezhin.jp/comic/4th_world_contest_49days)",
